   are historical.

   Upstream: github.com/thoitiettxl-cyber/cli-proxy-api, commit
   f912a733f84a3157e6570d84c05e5a02439d3ff0 (2026-08-28).
   License: MIT, Copyright (c) 2025 Hoang Nguyen.

   Copied verbatim: module/META-INF/com/google/android/
